    "text": "Saturday, May 30\nWest Milford Lions Club pancake breakfast, 8-11 a.m., West Milford Community Center. Pancakes and sausage with beverage, or sausage gravy and biscuits with beverage. Cost: $10 for all you can eat. Brooms, mops, dishcloths also available to buy. Raffle basket & 50/50. Proceeds benefit Lions Club community projects.",
